WEBVTT

00:00:01.281 --> 00:00:13.159
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.393 --> 00:00:18.965
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.965 --> 00:00:25.894
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:37.376
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.617 --> 00:00:43.557
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.557 --> 00:00:50.963
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:58.772
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.772 --> 00:01:05.645
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.645 --> 00:01:11.251
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.251 --> 00:01:17.524
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.524 --> 00:01:25.954
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:34.608 --> 00:01:36.439
That's it!

00:01:42.082 --> 00:01:44.209
Seal the shield walls!

00:01:48.488 --> 00:01:50.424
Cybele!

00:01:50.424 --> 00:01:53.560
Big Brother... Big Brother!

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:54.628
He's in!

00:01:54.628 --> 00:01:56.619
Switch to inside the shield!

00:02:05.505 --> 00:02:10.442
ENMA

00:02:12.112 --> 00:02:14.205
Kirchner...

00:02:17.884 --> 00:02:20.420
Quickly! Bring the high-speed
magnetic fields to maximum power!

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:22.911
T-The magnetic fields,
they're not functioning!

00:02:45.145 --> 00:02:46.772
Chitto?

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:48.948
Helga!

00:02:49.649 --> 00:02:51.640
Let's go back to the room!

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:05.127
W-What's that?!

00:03:10.504 --> 00:03:12.305
I-It's Orsel!

00:03:12.305 --> 00:03:14.307
Why is it coming from that ship?!

00:03:14.307 --> 00:03:16.332
It's him!
It's Kirchner!

00:03:19.446 --> 00:03:21.437
Let's get on board!

00:03:24.784 --> 00:03:26.376
Helga...

00:03:36.096 --> 00:03:37.330
What happened?

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:39.389
Professor, look at that!

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:49.501
K-Kirchner...

00:03:57.217 --> 00:03:58.985
Stop it, Kirchner!

00:03:58.985 --> 00:04:01.920
We have to return your body
to normal!

00:04:02.522 --> 00:04:04.391
It's too late.

00:04:04.391 --> 00:04:07.292
I'm begging you, return to the facility!

00:04:19.906 --> 00:04:23.364
Tarlant! Hasmodye!
You two search for Helga!

00:04:47.534 --> 00:04:49.803
-Professor Gherta!
-Don't fire!

00:04:49.803 --> 00:04:51.964
Don't interfere!

00:04:56.409 --> 00:05:00.447
It's our fault your body became like this.

00:05:00.447 --> 00:05:02.716
Get proper treatment.

00:05:02.716 --> 00:05:04.651
Please, Kirchner!

00:05:04.651 --> 00:05:10.323
Azado, Gina...
And then Sinon and Grass...

00:05:10.323 --> 00:05:12.450
They're already dead.

00:05:13.293 --> 00:05:15.989
I saw the two of them.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.498
Kirchner...

00:05:18.498 --> 00:05:23.026
We wanted to take care of Sinon
and Grass while they were still alive!

00:05:23.103 --> 00:05:24.771
If only we'd been faster...

00:05:24.771 --> 00:05:27.501
That's why at least you should
go back to the Ketplaque facility!

00:05:29.676 --> 00:05:33.009
Are you going to lock me up there
and repeat your experiment?!

00:05:33.313 --> 00:05:36.373
For the sake of you
scientists' prestige...

00:05:36.716 --> 00:05:39.549
My colleagues and I lost everything.

00:05:39.753 --> 00:05:41.388
Everything!

00:05:41.388 --> 00:05:42.689
That's not true!

00:05:42.689 --> 00:05:43.990
That experiment was...

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.458
...the first time mankind traveled
to the world of the dead.

00:05:46.559 --> 00:05:48.228
It was a noble deed.

00:05:48.228 --> 00:05:52.028
You and the others are the
heroes who demonstrated that!

00:05:52.966 --> 00:05:54.831
How stupid!

00:05:55.068 --> 00:05:56.660
Fire!

00:05:56.836 --> 00:05:58.565
Stop!

00:06:03.043 --> 00:06:05.773
Helga! Chitto!

00:06:11.651 --> 00:06:15.052
This... is the way you people do things.

00:06:15.588 --> 00:06:19.319
While saying you're going to
save me, you shoot me dead!

00:06:28.902 --> 00:06:31.063
Stop it, Kirchner!

00:06:31.504 --> 00:06:33.306
You!

00:06:33.306 --> 00:06:37.709
Kirchner! You are already dead!

00:06:48.054 --> 00:06:51.512
There was a really loud noise,
what do you suppose happened?

00:07:07.407 --> 00:07:08.999
Is that Helga's?

00:07:09.075 --> 00:07:09.776
Yeah...

00:07:09.776 --> 00:07:11.177
Who are you?!

00:07:11.177 --> 00:07:12.645
What are you doing here?!

00:07:12.645 --> 00:07:14.112
Out of the way!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:34.532
Hey! What are you two doing?
Hurry up!

00:07:37.904 --> 00:07:40.031
It's the Enma.

00:07:46.045 --> 00:07:48.411
Who's there?

00:07:48.748 --> 00:07:51.546
We're...

00:07:55.221 --> 00:07:57.280
Helga...

00:07:59.626 --> 00:08:03.619
Well, we were rescued by this ship.

00:08:03.963 --> 00:08:05.828
I see.

00:08:10.103 --> 00:08:14.164
Stop, Kirchner!
Don't release any more Orsel!

00:08:25.318 --> 00:08:28.412
We have to stop this!
We have to stop the Orsel!

00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:41.460
Enma!

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.230
Stop! Kirchner!

00:09:14.634 --> 00:09:16.703
Those Orsel emissions...

00:09:16.703 --> 00:09:19.572
are caused by the fact
that your soul is unstable!

00:09:19.572 --> 00:09:22.575
Your own soul is Orsel!

00:09:22.575 --> 00:09:26.739
If you use any more, your soul
will not be able to stabilize!

00:09:26.813 --> 00:09:28.147
Do you understand what that means?

00:09:28.147 --> 00:09:29.910
Shut up!

00:09:32.218 --> 00:09:36.314
Your life in the physical
world ended at that time!

00:09:40.693 --> 00:09:42.593
You are forcing that body...

00:09:42.996 --> 00:09:45.765
...to hang on with your fixation on life.

00:09:45.765 --> 00:09:47.200
But soon it will rot!

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:49.802
Stop it!

00:09:49.802 --> 00:09:51.861
What are you saying?

00:09:52.205 --> 00:09:55.041
The Zone is a world where
Orsel must be stable!

00:09:55.041 --> 00:09:58.978
If you don't accept death,
your soul won't stabilize!

00:09:58.978 --> 00:10:01.648
If you stay like that, your
body will be destroyed,

00:10:01.648 --> 00:10:04.048
and you will go into the
Zone in an unstable state.

00:10:04.183 --> 00:10:07.550
If that happens, it could lead to
the collapse of the universe!

00:10:17.063 --> 00:10:20.931
The universe, Enma will not allow that!

00:10:36.649 --> 00:10:39.519
You still have time.
Kirchner!

00:10:39.519 --> 00:10:43.455
If you accept death now,
your soul can be saved!

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:57.236
The Enma is trying to
erase his soul! Aghi!

00:10:57.804 --> 00:10:59.499
Kirchner!

00:11:03.876 --> 00:11:06.145
You've entered the Zone one
time before!

00:11:06.145 --> 00:11:08.014
You've seen the universe of death.

00:11:08.014 --> 00:11:11.617
If your soul is destroyed, you
can never be reborn again!

00:11:11.617 --> 00:11:13.949
I want to save you!

00:12:20.753 --> 00:12:22.482
It's starting!

00:12:22.789 --> 00:12:26.054
W-What is going on?

00:12:33.466 --> 00:12:34.700
Do it quickly!

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:38.466
Seal off all the passageways leading
to the laboratory section! All of them!

00:12:43.810 --> 00:12:45.505
Hurry!

00:13:08.768 --> 00:13:10.803
W-What is this?

00:13:10.803 --> 00:13:12.839
It's Enma's barrier!

00:13:12.839 --> 00:13:14.540
Barrier?

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:19.705
When a soul is destroyed, it's meant
to protect this world from the effects!

00:13:35.328 --> 00:13:39.560
I have to... protect Cybele...

00:13:40.399 --> 00:13:42.731
Cybele!

00:13:53.045 --> 00:13:55.815
I-I can't die...

00:13:55.815 --> 00:14:00.218
For Cybele's sake, I can't die!

00:14:02.255 --> 00:14:07.260
Kirchner! The Enma are trying to
erase your soul from the universe!

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:09.091
Do you understand...

00:14:12.398 --> 00:14:15.134
Do-Do you understand
what that means?!

00:14:15.134 --> 00:14:18.695
Your feelings for your sister...

00:14:18.871 --> 00:14:22.602
-Aghi!
-Will disappear forever!

00:14:28.848 --> 00:14:31.248
Aghi! Just stop!

00:14:31.417 --> 00:14:33.817
At this point,
there's nothing you can do!

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:36.151
Aghi!

00:14:40.893 --> 00:14:43.054
Kirchner...

00:14:47.366 --> 00:14:53.168
As long as you have your soul,
those feelings will never disappear!

00:14:56.842 --> 00:15:01.480
Those feelings will definitely
lead your sister to happiness!

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:03.311
Please understand!

00:15:04.951 --> 00:15:09.115
I want to save you! Kirchner!

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:15.752
Aghi!

00:15:15.895 --> 00:15:17.260
Look!

00:15:18.331 --> 00:15:21.494
His soul is reaching critical mass!

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:29.308
Kirchner's soul is...

00:15:29.308 --> 00:15:31.299
...being annihilated.

00:16:06.646 --> 00:16:08.748
It looks like it stopped.

00:16:08.748 --> 00:16:11.216
-Are you okay, Helga?
-Yes.

00:16:16.522 --> 00:16:18.786
Are you all right?

00:16:19.392 --> 00:16:21.758
Thank you.

00:16:42.214 --> 00:16:44.011
What is it?

00:17:55.788 --> 00:17:57.949
Big Brother...

00:18:20.513 --> 00:18:22.242
Aghi...

00:18:23.149 --> 00:18:25.447
You children...

00:18:25.851 --> 00:18:27.785
I remember!

00:18:29.121 --> 00:18:32.090
The picture of the
Children of Befort!

00:18:32.525 --> 00:18:35.187
White hair...

00:18:36.262 --> 00:18:38.787
Blue eyes...

00:18:40.733 --> 00:18:45.363
I just thought you were just the
delusions of a deranged scholar but...

00:18:47.239 --> 00:18:48.741
What are you?

00:18:48.741 --> 00:18:50.976
For 500 years, have you really...

00:18:50.976 --> 00:18:53.467
That doesn't matter!

00:18:53.612 --> 00:18:55.414
I'm warning you!

00:18:55.414 --> 00:18:58.551
I don't know what kind of machine
you've managed to develop,

00:18:58.551 --> 00:19:00.920
but don't do anything else
with the Zone!

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:02.822
Stop development immediately!

00:19:02.822 --> 00:19:06.091
If you don't, I'll destroy
it by force if I have to.

00:19:06.091 --> 00:19:10.529
Neither you nor we are ready
to be interfering with the Zone.

00:19:10.529 --> 00:19:13.896
No, the Zone should never
have been meddled with at all!

00:19:15.801 --> 00:19:17.860
The Zone?

00:19:24.009 --> 00:19:26.011
Helga! Chitto!

00:19:26.011 --> 00:19:28.581
-Thoma!
-Don't "Thoma" me!

00:19:28.581 --> 00:19:30.649
I've been worried, Chitto!

00:19:30.649 --> 00:19:32.640
I'm sorry.

00:19:35.521 --> 00:19:38.388
Anyway, I'm glad you're okay.

00:19:41.594 --> 00:19:43.858
Who are those guys?!

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:20.221
You're Aghi, right?

00:20:20.599 --> 00:20:22.999
I just met with my big brother.

00:20:23.269 --> 00:20:27.205
He was grateful to you.
He said, "Thank you."

00:20:29.742 --> 00:20:32.108
He made it.

00:20:42.221 --> 00:20:44.621
You're Helga, right?

00:20:45.591 --> 00:20:49.550
We've been looking for you
for a long time.

00:20:55.034 --> 00:20:57.202
We want to talk to Helga.

00:20:57.202 --> 00:21:02.265
We'll listen to you, but if you do
anything to Helga, you'll pay for it!

00:21:02.308 --> 00:21:03.741
I understand.

00:21:29.001 --> 00:21:30.969
Hello, Cole residence.

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:34.430
Hello? Hello?

00:21:35.207 --> 00:21:37.505
Who is this?

00:21:37.943 --> 00:21:42.607
Big Brother? Big Brother Ian?

00:21:51.223 --> 00:21:55.694
The constellation Taurus,
the stars at the end,

00:21:55.694 --> 00:22:00.495
the star cluster called the
Pleiades, is 400 light years away.

00:22:00.699 --> 00:22:05.398
Beyond that area of space, a
distant 200 million light years away,

00:22:05.604 --> 00:22:09.441
there is a shining blue planet of water.

00:22:09.441 --> 00:22:11.310
Greecia.

00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:14.370
Our home.

00:22:34.733 --> 00:22:44.540
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:44.810 --> 00:22:54.653
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:54.653 --> 00:22:59.386
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:22:59.425 --> 00:23:04.260
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:04.663 --> 00:23:13.799
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:13.906 --> 00:23:18.977
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:18.977 --> 00:23:24.249
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:24.249 --> 00:23:28.652
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:28.687 --> 00:23:32.991
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:32.991 --> 00:23:37.860
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
